<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish May producer prices up 0.4 pct m/m-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish May producer prices up 0.4 pct m/m-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for manufacturing industries rose 0.4 percent in May and were down 1.5 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Friday.</p>
<p>   Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>May 1997	119.7	   +0.4		-1.5</p>
<p>Apr 1997	119.2	   +0.4		-1.7</p>
<p>May 1996	121.5	   +0.2		+1.7</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
